From 436b4d6b143e697304033e6f29880ee3e1503f8a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Patrick Lawler <patricktlawler@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 28 Sep 2026 18:03:48 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] wifi-scripts: fsync board.json before replacing it

wifi-detect.uc replaces /etc/board.json by writing board.json.new and
renaming it over the old file. On UBIFS the rename can reach the flash
before the file data, so a power cut within the writeback window
(~30 s) leaves an empty board.json behind. wifi-detect.uc then fails
to parse it on every following boot, nothing regenerates it, and the
wireless setup fails for good ("PHY is undefined").

The file is rewritten on every boot: "wifi config" runs from
/etc/init.d/boot before kmodloader and drops the phys that are not
there yet, and their hotplug events add them back. On a device with
ath11k/ath12k this means three rewrites 10-17 s after power-on, so any
power cut in the first ~50 s of a boot can hit the window.

Flush the new file with fsync before the rename.

Signed-off-by: Patrick Lawler <patricktlawler@gmail.com>

[SBE1V1K: OpenWrt PR https://github.com/openwrt/openwrt/pull/25471
 head 436b4d6b143e697304033e6f29880ee3e1503f8a, unchanged.]
---
 package/network/config/wifi-scripts/Makefile                   | 2 +-
 .../config/wifi-scripts/files/usr/share/hostap/wifi-detect.uc  | 3 +++
 2 files changed, 4 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/package/network/config/wifi-scripts/Makefile b/package/network/config/wifi-scripts/Makefile
index b4b1a72b176435..7499d0eb46ae6d 100644
--- a/package/network/config/wifi-scripts/Makefile
+++ b/package/network/config/wifi-scripts/Makefile
@@ -9,7 +9,7 @@ include $(TOPDIR)/rules.mk
 
 PKG_NAME:=wifi-scripts
 PKG_VERSION:=1.0
-PKG_RELEASE:=2
+PKG_RELEASE:=3
 PKG_LICENSE:=GPL-2.0
 
 PKG_MAINTAINER:=Felix Fietkau <nbd@nbd.name>
diff --git a/package/network/config/wifi-scripts/files/usr/share/hostap/wifi-detect.uc b/package/network/config/wifi-scripts/files/usr/share/hostap/wifi-detect.uc
index ccaa86b2069399..7fb0f5d99f4f46 100644
--- a/package/network/config/wifi-scripts/files/usr/share/hostap/wifi-detect.uc
+++ b/package/network/config/wifi-scripts/files/usr/share/hostap/wifi-detect.uc
@@ -263,5 +263,8 @@ if (!is_equal(prev_board_data, board_data)) {
 		exit(1);
 	f.write(sprintf("%.J\n", board_data));
 	f.close();
+	// flush the data before the rename, otherwise a power cut can leave
+	// an empty board.json behind (e.g. on UBIFS)
+	system([ "fsync", new_file ]);
 	rename(new_file, board_file);
 }
